# Agent coordination lock
# An agent writes its name here before editing, and clears the file when done.
# Any other agent MUST check this file before starting work:
#   - empty  -> safe to start; write your name, then begin.
#   - your name -> you already hold the lock; proceed.
#   - someone else's name -> STOP. Do not edit. Ask the user to coordinate a handoff.
# See AGENTS.md for the full protocol.